    "id": "banked-slalom-snowboard-zero-g-2026-03-28",
    "title": "Banked Slalom Snowboard Zero G",
    "description": "Sport & Leisure🔥 The Banked Slalom at La Flégère is back! 🔥After a successful first edition last year, we created an association for our events: VIRAGES, supported by Zero G and Season Guiding.We're doing it again for a 100% snowboard day on the sunniest side of Chamonix, at least we hope so this year ;)A slightly different course, new banked turns, but the same great vibe! If you loved it last year, you'll adore this edition. If you missed it, now's the time to join us.No-pressure competition, just great riding among enthusiasts, carving, fun, and a friendly day where snowboarding reigns supreme. Whether you're coming to challenge yourself or just for the pleasure of carving between the gates, we're waiting for you to share a great time on the slopes!🏔️🎉 📅 PRACTICAL INFORMATION📍 Location: Bottom of the INDEX slope, La Flégère🚡 Access: Flégère gondola + Index chairlift⏳ Date: Saturday, March 28, 2026⏰ PROGRAM☕ 8:30-9:30 AM: Welcome & bib collection (Flégère gondola)👀 9:00-11:30 AM: Course familiarization🏁 12:00-1:30 PM: First run🏁 2:00-3:30 PM: Second run🏆 5:30 PM: Meet at L'Hydromel for the awards ceremony🎶 7:00 PM: DJ Set - SKREDRegistrations:v",
